# Environment
@hosturl = http://localhost:4000
@authToken =
@xTenantId = acme

### 1. Audit trail of one address (newest first)
POST {{hosturl}}/audit-log-search
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
x-tenant-id: {{xTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entity": "address",
  "entityId": "64f50ed5-c754-4bbb-980a-adf93a6d868e",
  "limit": 20
}

### 2. Every UPDATE of the tenant
POST {{hosturl}}/audit-log-search
x-tenant-id: {{xTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "action": "UPDATE" }

### 3. One audit entry (id from the search)
GET {{hosturl}}/audit-log-entity/REPLACE_WITH_ID
x-tenant-id: {{xTenantId}}
